      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HALLEBESOFINE (2) added to a string of wins and placings when she took out a Vicbred heat two back before a brave second in the Group 1 final, beaten just 1.5m. Hard to knock her recent consistency and she should get every chance from a low draw. JILLIBY AURA (4) had a second line draw when fifth in the Vicbred final but had led to win her heat when resuming here prior. Big chance back on the front row. HARPERSEVEN (5) was midfield in the Vicbred final at her latest appearance but had placed in her other two outings here off a spell and won the only time she attempted this shorter distance. ALDEBARAN ADA (8) draws for a trail and has won both previous third-up attempts so could find her best.",
